--------------------------------------------------STEP 11: SAVE FILE--------------------------------------------------
Press:
CTRL + X
Then press:
Y
Then press:
ENTER
--------------------------------------------------STEP 12: FIND UBUNTU VM IP ADDRESS--------------------------------------------------
Type:
ip a
OR
hostname -I
Example output:
192.168.56.10
--------------------------------------------------STEP 13: OPEN WEBSITE IN BROWSER--------------------------------------------------
On Windows browser open:
http://YOUR_IP_ADDRESS
Example:
http://192.168.56.10
OR simply try:
http://localhost:8080
(if port forwarding is configured)
--------------------------------------------------OPTIONAL PORT FORWARDING--------------------------------------------------
Exit VM:
exit
Open Vagrantfile on Windows.
Add this line below config.vm.box:
config.vm.network "forwarded_port", guest: 80, host: 8080
Save file.
Restart VM:
vagrant reload
Now open:
http://localhost:8080
